    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Hell Yeah!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotten is a 2D top-down shooter with roguelike elements where you fight hordes of enemies using a huge variety of weapons and modifiers. Be free to create crazy synergies and combinations to become stronger every round!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ Different modifiers (upgrades)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing a round grants you the chance of choosing a modifier! Modifiers are stackable upgrades that can change the way you play the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akimbo!<br>Dual wield any of the 30+ different weapons, creating wacky weapon combinations that fit your play-style perfectly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extend your arena!<br>Use credits to unlock different parts of the stage to get access to more weapons and resources!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve!<br>Unlock stronger modifiers and weapons by earning XP from every run you make!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Hell Yeah!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotten is a 2D top-down shooter with roguelike elements where you fight hordes of enemies using a huge variety of weapons and modifiers. Be free to create crazy synergies and combinations to become stronger every round!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ Different modifiers (upgrades)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing a round grants you the chance of choosing a modifier! Modifiers are stackable upgrades that can change the way you play the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akimbo!<br>Dual wield any of the 30+ different weapons, creating wacky weapon combinations that fit your play-style perfectly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extend your arena!<br>Use credits to unlock different parts of the stage to get access to more weapons and resources!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve!<br>Unlock stronger modifiers and weapons by earning XP from every run you make!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Rotten is the ULTIMATE 2D top-down horde survivor game! Fight massive hordes of bizarre enemies! Upgrade your equipment, create crazy combinations between all of the different weapons and modifiers and become an unstoppable force!",
